{"parse": {"title": "Puppet Star", "pageid": 5438, "revid": 43010, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Puppet Star</b> added in Update 18, is a reward obtained from reaching Room 100 in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Infinity Castle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSW5maW5pdHlfQ2FzdGxlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Infinity Castle</span> (11th Season).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Infomation\">Infomation</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"color:#FFC208;\">+Required to obtain a special unit...</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fc4242;\">This Star is sealed with a powerful magic and cannot be opened yet...</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Robot_Sorceror\" title=\"Robot Sorceror\"><img alt=\"Robot Sorceror\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/f8/Robot_Sorceror.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20250310175204\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Robot Sorceror.png\" data-image-key=\"Robot_Sorceror.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Robot Sorceror</div></dd>\n<